msgid "ROS and VIO tracking camera for non-GPS Navigation"
msgstr "使用 ROS 和 VIO 跟踪相机实现无 GPS 导航"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:7
#: 62d88b2397bb4815b66abb0171a469fc
msgid ""
"This wiki page describes how a `VIO tracking camera "
"<https://www.intelrealsense.com/visual-inertial-tracking-case-study/>`__ "
"such as the `Intel RealSense T265 <https://www.intelrealsense.com/tracking-"
"camera-t265/>`__ can be used with ROS to facilitate non-GPS flight."
msgstr ""
"本 wiki 页面介绍了如何将 `VIO 跟踪相机 <https://www.intelrealsense.com/visual-inertial-"
"tracking-case-study/>`__（如 `Intel RealSense T265 "
"<https://www.intelrealsense.com/tracking-camera-t265/>`__）与 ROS 配合使用，实现无 GPS"
" 飞行。"

