#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:20
#: fe0a11faf0544045bd345fd5ea7a286a
msgid ""
"Sensor: `Intel RealSense Tracking Camera T265 "
"<https://www.intelrealsense.com/tracking-camera-t265/>`__"
msgstr ""
"传感器：`Intel RealSense 跟踪相机 T265 <https://www.intelrealsense.com/tracking-"
"camera-t265/>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:21
#: 9057cac1b7c34ba085b79351ef25a171
msgid ""
"Companion computer: `Raspberry Pi 3 Model B "
"<https://www.raspberrypi.org/products/raspberry-pi-3-model-b/>`__"
msgstr ""
"伴飞计算机：`Raspberry Pi 3 Model B "
"<https://www.raspberrypi.org/products/raspberry-pi-3-model-b/>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:24
#: eb85bcb3da4a4f20b909e0192e0794e4
msgid ""
"Depends on what you need from the T265, the companion computer should have "
"USB2 (**pose** data only) or USB3 (**pose** + **image** data). For "
"localization and navigation, we only need to capture pose data, so RPi 3B is"
" sufficient for the task."
msgstr ""
"根据对 T265 的需求，伴飞计算机应具备 USB2（仅**姿态**数据）或 USB3（**姿态** + "
"**图像**数据）。对于定位和导航，我们只需捕获姿态数据，因此 RPi 3B 即可满足需求。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:27
#: 211d348d86784990819e0f81fddec249
msgid "System Overview"
msgstr "系统概述"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:32
#: bce56d2819c44ae0a17196d637ae26f1
msgid ""
"The position data obtained from ``realsense-ros`` node will be processed by "
"``vision_to_mavros`` node and send to ``mavros`` node via the topic "
"``/mavros/vision_pose/pose``. ``mavros`` will take care of the ENU - NED "
"frames transformation and send it to ArduPilot through MAVLink."
msgstr ""
"从 ``realsense-ros`` 节点获取的位置数据将由 ``vision_to_mavros`` 节点处理，并通过话题 "
"``/mavros/vision_pose/pose`` 发送至 ``mavros`` 节点。``mavros`` 负责完成 ENU 到 NED "
"坐标系的转换，并通过 MAVLink 发送给 ArduPilot。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:35
#: bd9cf00a08ca492caaab9a05ed50b8ce
msgid "Install ``librealsense``"
msgstr "安装 ``librealsense``"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:38
#: b35f38ad1e7d42efbadbbcc734441dc5
msgid ""
"The Realsense T265 is supported via `librealsense "
"<https://github.com/IntelRealSense/librealsense>`__ on Windows and Linux. "
"Installation process varies widely for different systems. Refer to `the "
"official github page <https://github.com/IntelRealSense/librealsense>`__ for"
" instructions on specific system, such as `Jetson "
"<https://github.com/IntelRealSense/librealsense/blob/master/doc/installation_jetson.md>`__,"
" `Odroid "
"<https://github.com/IntelRealSense/librealsense/blob/master/doc/installation_odroid.md>`__,"
" `Windows "
"<https://github.com/IntelRealSense/librealsense/blob/master/doc/installation_windows.md>`__,"
" `Raspbian "
"<https://github.com/IntelRealSense/librealsense/blob/master/doc/installation_raspbian.md>`__."
msgstr ""
"Realsense T265 在 Windows 和 Linux 上通过 `librealsense "
"<https://github.com/IntelRealSense/librealsense>`__ "
"提供支持。不同系统的安装过程差异较大。特定系统的安装说明请参阅 `官方 github 页面 "
"<https://github.com/IntelRealSense/librealsense>`__，例如 `Jetson "
"<https://github.com/IntelRealSense/librealsense/blob/master/doc/installation_jetson.md>`__、`Odroid"
" "
"<https://github.com/IntelRealSense/librealsense/blob/master/doc/installation_odroid.md>`__、`Windows"
" "
"<https://github.com/IntelRealSense/librealsense/blob/master/doc/installation_windows.md>`__、`Raspbian"
" "
"<https://github.com/IntelRealSense/librealsense/blob/master/doc/installation_raspbian.md>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:40
#: 8439f92c0e0a4ba5b018ce1739005b30
msgid ""
"The following steps are intended for Ubuntu Linux. Since no Debian package "
"is available for RPi, ``librealsense`` must be built from source."
msgstr ""
"以下步骤适用于 Ubuntu Linux。由于 RPi 没有可用的 Debian 软件包，``librealsense`` 必须从源码编译。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:42
#: 5b1c2e9ac6584a01be8ed16546cbbf5b
msgid ""
"**Install OS** (if you have not done so): `Ubuntu MATE 16.04 LTS "
"<https://ubuntu-mate.org/blog/ubuntu-mate-xenial-final-release/>`__."
msgstr ""
"**安装操作系统**（如尚未安装）：`Ubuntu MATE 16.04 LTS <https://ubuntu-"
"mate.org/blog/ubuntu-mate-xenial-final-release/>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:43
#: 242d7d20b3b24877b78ed20109ef68ed
msgid ""
"**Increase swap size**: RPi does not have enough RAM to compile the SDK, "
"hence swap size needs to be increased. Swap size of 2048 (2GB) seems to work"
" well, but you can go with less."
msgstr ""
"**增大交换空间**：RPi 的 RAM 不足以编译 SDK，因此需要增大交换空间。2048（2GB）的交换空间通常可正常工作，也可使用更小的值。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:66
#: 9e5c5dce058847a7bed9edeef431b128
msgid "**Clone librealsense repo and compile SDK**"
msgstr "**克隆 librealsense 仓库并编译 SDK**"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:107
#: fd505c5076084105ad89ede26929e58f
msgid ""
"**Test that librealsense is installed correctly**: The easiest way is to "
"plug in the T265 and play with the `examples "
"<https://github.com/IntelRealSense/librealsense/tree/master/examples>`__ and"
" `tools "
"<https://github.com/IntelRealSense/librealsense/tree/master/tools>`__ "
"included in the SDK."
msgstr ""
"**测试 librealsense 是否正确安装**：最简便的方法是插入 T265，运行 SDK 附带的 `示例 "
"<https://github.com/IntelRealSense/librealsense/tree/master/examples>`__ 和 "
"`工具 <https://github.com/IntelRealSense/librealsense/tree/master/tools>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:109
#: 95d1d498544047548433407b4ba13b27
msgid ""
"If you have a monitor plugged in, you can open `Intel Realsense Viewer "
"<https://github.com/IntelRealSense/librealsense/tree/master/tools/realsense-"
"viewer>`__ by typing in into the terminal: ``realsense-viewer``. If the T265"
" is connected, the device will be available on the left panel. Click on the "
"slider to start the device and switch to 3D view. Move the T265 around and "
"you should see its trajectory."
msgstr ""
"若已连接显示器，可在终端输入 ``realsense-viewer`` 打开 `Intel Realsense Viewer "
"<https://github.com/IntelRealSense/librealsense/tree/master/tools/realsense-"
"viewer>`__。若 T265 已连接，设备将显示在左侧面板。点击滑块启动设备并切换到 3D 视图，移动 T265 即可看到其运动轨迹。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:110
#: 5898a9a009c24f7bafe7a73dcac80e48
msgid ""
"If no monitor is connected, other demos can also be launched from the "
"terminal, for example ``rs-pose``, ``rs-pose-predict``, ``rs-capture`` etc."
msgstr ""
"若未连接显示器，也可从终端启动其他演示程序，例如 ``rs-pose``、``rs-pose-predict``、``rs-capture`` 等。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:112
#: 0bb3b1fc24194757901c2ec3428738b4
msgid ""
"**Test pyrealsense2 python wrapper**: If you enabled building Python wrapper"
" (``BUILD_PYTHON_BINDINGS`` flag), the compiled library is located in the "
"build folder: ``~/librealsense/build/wrappers/python``."
msgstr ""
"**测试 pyrealsense2 Python 封装**：若在构建时启用了 Python 封装（``BUILD_PYTHON_BINDINGS`` "
"标志），编译后的库位于构建文件夹：``~/librealsense/build/wrappers/python``。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:114
#: a5667349e4ac4bb5bdb63c8c33ef17cc
msgid ""
"Update the ``PYTHONPATH`` environment variable to add the path to the "
"``pyrealsense`` library: ``export PYTHONPATH=$PYTHONPATH:/usr/local/lib``. "
"Alternatively, copy the build output (``librealsense2.so`` and "
"``pyrealsense2.so`` files, located in ``~/librealsense/build/``) next to "
"your script."
msgstr ""
"更新 ``PYTHONPATH`` 环境变量以添加 ``pyrealsense`` 库的路径：``export "
"PYTHONPATH=$PYTHONPATH:/usr/local/lib``。或者，将构建输出文件（``librealsense2.so`` 和 "
"``pyrealsense2.so``，位于 ``~/librealsense/build/``）复制到脚本所在目录。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:115
#: 60fc33ef2afe4cf99fece827aa9f0aac
msgid ""
"The basic examples provided by Intel can be found in the folder "
"``~/librealsense/wrappers/python/example``. Run it with Python3."
msgstr ""
"Intel 提供的基础示例可在 ``~/librealsense/wrappers/python/example`` 文件夹中找到。使用 Python3"
" 运行。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:127
#: 1b2e89d705184165888097330e0bfe74
msgid ""
"The RPi 3B with USB2 cannot handle the image streams. Trying to display the "
"fisheye images might crash the application."
msgstr "带 USB2 的 RPi 3B 无法处理图像流。尝试显示鱼眼图像可能导致应用程序崩溃。"

