#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:178
#: ab4dca09a8b74c458e3323bd4b80f7d6
msgid ""
"Modify parameters according to your T265 camera's orientation: The default "
"parameters are set for a **front-facing camera**. In the launch file "
"``t265_tf_to_mavros.launch``, modify params ``roll_cam``, ``pitch_cam``, "
"``yaw_cam``, ``gamma_world`` from the list of values or with your own values"
" corresponding to your setup."
msgstr ""
"根据您的 T265 相机朝向修改参数：默认参数适用于**前向相机**。在启动文件 ``t265_tf_to_mavros.launch`` "
"中，从参数列表中选择或自定义 ``roll_cam``、``pitch_cam``、``yaw_cam``、``gamma_world`` "
"参数值以匹配您的安装方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:181
#: f61db2b1503e473798e76ebcdc2bce41
msgid ""
"There is a `known issue "
"<https://github.com/IntelRealSense/librealsense/issues/4080>`__ about "
"inconsistent yaw angle for **down facing** orientation and some workarounds "
"have been discussed. As of this writing, here is what seems to work: the "
"camera needs to be slightly tilted (i.e. not completely flat out) when it "
"starts streaming poses (launching ``realsense-ros`` or calling "
"``librealsense``’s API to invoke pose data. Otherwise, the yaw angle of the "
"world coordinates might be randomly initialized."
msgstr ""
"关于**朝下**安装时偏航角不一致的 `已知问题 "
"<https://github.com/IntelRealSense/librealsense/issues/4080>`__ "
"已有讨论，并给出了一些解决方法。截至本文撰写时，以下方法似乎有效：相机在开始发布位姿数据时（启动 ``realsense-ros`` 或调用 "
"``librealsense`` API 获取位姿数据时），需要略微倾斜（即不完全水平放置）。否则，世界坐标系的偏航角可能会被随机初始化。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:184
#: cf6b8a46d73747dc9e18c46e416d1f74
msgid "Configure ArduPilot"
msgstr "配置 ArduPilot"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:186
#: 9f2b890c30df4e0591dd82c85206c9f7
msgid ""
"Connect to the flight controller with a ground station (i.e. Mission "
"Planner) and check that the following parameters are set as shown below:"
msgstr "使用地面站（如 Mission Planner）连接飞行控制器，并确认以下参数按如下设置："

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:188
#: f009e16d8a3d4f3cb9af806c102465cb
msgid ""
"`AHRS_EKF_TYPE <https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/parameters.html#ahrs-ekf-"
"type>`__ = 2 (the default) to use EKF2 (as of this writing, EKF3 is not "
"supported for handling external navigation data)"
msgstr ""
"`AHRS_EKF_TYPE <https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/parameters.html#ahrs-ekf-"
"type>`__ = 2（默认值），使用 EKF2（截至本文撰写时，EKF3 不支持处理外部导航数据）"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:189
#: 5942fa3a15e24f79bceb5f70e88c3613
msgid ""
"`EK2_ENABLE "
"<https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/parameters.html#ek2-enable>`__ = 1 (the "
"default)"
msgstr ""
"`EK2_ENABLE "
"<https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/parameters.html#ek2-enable>`__ = 1（默认值）"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:190
#: 3d74e2e6c3974d6383f0a9fbae02576c
msgid ""
"`EK3_ENABLE "
"<https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/parameters.html#ek3-enable>`__ = 0 (the "
"default)"
msgstr ""
"`EK3_ENABLE "
"<https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/parameters.html#ek3-enable>`__ = 0（默认值）"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:191
#: 202828f85bef4196918c64e5ed71c06e
msgid ""
"`GPS_TYPE <https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/parameters.html#gps-type>`__ = "
"0 to disable the GPS"
msgstr ""
"`GPS_TYPE <https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/parameters.html#gps-type>`__ = "
"0，禁用 GPS"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:192
#: e495cef006794757a74436d776357fc0
msgid ""
"`EK2_GPS_TYPE <https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/parameters.html#ek2-gps-"
"type>`__ = 3 to disable the EKF’s use of the GPS"
msgstr ""
"`EK2_GPS_TYPE <https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/parameters.html#ek2-gps-"
"type>`__ = 3，禁止 EKF 使用 GPS"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:193
#: ff3f7a16b3a340d38a4931ece05bc1f6
msgid ""
"`EK2_POSNE_M_NSE "
"<https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/parameters.html#ek2-posne-m-nse-gps-"
"horizontal-position-measurement-noise-m>`__ = 0.1"
msgstr ""
"`EK2_POSNE_M_NSE "
"<https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/parameters.html#ek2-posne-m-nse-gps-"
"horizontal-position-measurement-noise-m>`__ = 0.1"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:194
#: af7664173b0d47098d865b1e30342d1e
msgid ""
"`EK2_VELD_M_NSE <https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/parameters.html#ek2-veld-"
"m-nse-gps-vertical-velocity-measurement-noise-m-s>`__ = 0.1"
msgstr ""
"`EK2_VELD_M_NSE <https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/parameters.html#ek2-veld-"
"m-nse-gps-vertical-velocity-measurement-noise-m-s>`__ = 0.1"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:195
#: 0f48e6681bee4bdc8b3e2cd10f9a0905
msgid ""
"`EK2_VELNE_M_NSE "
"<https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/parameters.html#ek2-velne-m-nse-gps-"
"horizontal-velocity-measurement-noise-m-s>`__ = 0.1"
msgstr ""
"`EK2_VELNE_M_NSE "
"<https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/parameters.html#ek2-velne-m-nse-gps-"
"horizontal-velocity-measurement-noise-m-s>`__ = 0.1"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:196
#: 5f7f3b5e622f42f5b9737393fa7bdcc3
msgid ""
":ref:`COMPASS_ENABLE<copter:COMPASS_ENABLE>` = 0,  `COMPASS_USE "
"<https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/parameters.html#compass-use-use-compass-"
"for-yaw>`__ = 0, `COMPASS_USE2 "
"<https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/parameters.html#compass-use2>`__ = 0, "
"`COMPASS_USE3 <https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/parameters.html#compass-"
"use3>`__ = 0 to disable the EKF’s use of the compass and instead rely on the"
" heading from external navigation data."
msgstr ""
":ref:`COMPASS_ENABLE<copter:COMPASS_ENABLE>` = 0、`COMPASS_USE "
"<https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/parameters.html#compass-use-use-compass-"
"for-yaw>`__ = 0、`COMPASS_USE2 "
"<https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/parameters.html#compass-use2>`__ = "
"0、`COMPASS_USE3 <https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/parameters.html#compass-"
"use3>`__ = 0，禁止 EKF 使用罗盘，转而依赖外部导航数据提供的航向"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:198
#: 03813d04a030495596f8f2140c85b70e
msgid "After the parameters are modified, reboot the flight controller."
msgstr "修改参数后，重启飞行控制器。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:201
#: 2df2be117610459188666620634633df
msgid "Verify that all ROS nodes are working"
msgstr "验证所有 ROS 节点正常运行"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:203
#: 35f9cc4de99842768952d5d705832c76
msgid ""
"There are 3 ROS nodes running in this setup: ``realsense-ros``, ``mavros`` "
"and ``vision_to_mavros``. Launch in 3 separated terminals on:"
msgstr ""
"此方案中共运行 3 个 ROS 节点：``realsense-ros``、``mavros`` 和 ``vision_to_mavros``。分别在 3"
" 个独立终端中启动："

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:205
#: dcaa6352aa314710a2fe1eeeb78a91c0
msgid ""
"``realsense-ros`` node: ``roslaunch realsense2_camera rs_t265.launch``."
msgstr "``realsense-ros`` 节点：``roslaunch realsense2_camera rs_t265.launch``。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:207
#: f8c23ad403a948dd8e901aa2e7ac5dc7
msgid ""
"The topic ``/camera/odom/sample/`` and ``/tf`` should be published at 200Hz."
msgstr "话题 ``/camera/odom/sample/`` 和 ``/tf`` 应以 200Hz 频率发布。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:209
#: ff6c37d57205418cb5f2b48825170565
msgid ""
"``mavros`` node: ``roslaunch mavros apm.launch`` (with ``fcu_url`` and other"
" parameters in ``apm.launch`` modified to your setup)."
msgstr ""
"``mavros`` 节点：``roslaunch mavros apm.launch``（需根据您的配置修改 ``apm.launch`` 中的 "
"``fcu_url`` 及其他参数）。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:211
#: 66138eea5c254438a17a3118f65b0920
msgid "``rostopic echo /mavros/state`` should show that FCU is connected."
msgstr "``rostopic echo /mavros/state`` 应显示 FCU 已连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:212
#: 81b862ba3eb541168d4ced14a25ed12a
msgid "``rostopic echo /mavros/vision_pose/pose`` is not published."
msgstr "此时 ``rostopic echo /mavros/vision_pose/pose`` 尚未发布数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:214
#: 134e5480ba8d48a2b64bc5b25e9ddc79
msgid ""
"``vision_to_mavros`` node: ``roslaunch vision_to_mavros "
"t265_tf_to_mavros.launch``"
msgstr ""
"``vision_to_mavros`` 节点：``roslaunch vision_to_mavros "
"t265_tf_to_mavros.launch``"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:216
#: 8154ec8c2a054ae69f29de8580507a9b
msgid ""
"``rostopic echo /mavros/vision_pose/pose`` should now show pose data from "
"the T265."
msgstr "``rostopic echo /mavros/vision_pose/pose`` 现在应显示来自 T265 的位姿数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:217
#: b6f7554d61664147b4e810df32d1ec62
msgid ""
"``rostopic hz /mavros/vision_pose/pose`` should show that the topic is being"
" published at 30Hz."
msgstr "``rostopic hz /mavros/vision_pose/pose`` 应显示该话题以 30Hz 频率发布。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:219
#: 9e3c0fee257d4f8589b52d67b62f3f01
msgid ""
"To verify that ArduPilot is receiving ``VISION_POSITION_ESTIMATE`` on "
"Mission Planner: press ``Ctrl+F`` and click on “Mavlink Inspector”, you "
"should be able to see data coming in."
msgstr ""
"要在 Mission Planner 中验证 ArduPilot 是否收到 ``VISION_POSITION_ESTIMATE``：按 "
"``Ctrl+F`` 并点击「Mavlink Inspector」，应能看到数据传入。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:224
#: 492dbc79cf384f95935b16f803bc1679
msgid ""
"Once all of the nodes can run successfully, next time you can launch all of "
"them at once with ``roslaunch vision_to_mavros t265_all_nodes.launch``, "
"which will launch:"
msgstr ""
"所有节点均能成功运行后，下次可使用 ``roslaunch vision_to_mavros t265_all_nodes.launch`` "
"一次性启动所有节点，该命令将启动："

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:226
#: 66f6ee9aecf74da99a72ce24198df66f
msgid ""
"``rs_t265.launch``, as originally provided by ``realsense-ros``, no "
"modification needed."
msgstr "``rs_t265.launch``，使用 ``realsense-ros`` 原始提供的文件，无需修改。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:228
#: 4aa017aca2534dae8f78ba9862a949aa
msgid "``apm.launch``, modified with your own configuration."
msgstr "``apm.launch``，已根据您的配置修改。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:230
#: 8ea662889db64c65b26a5e286e9a3c66
msgid ""
"``t265_tf_to_mavros.launch`` with parameters according to your T265’s "
"orientation."
msgstr "``t265_tf_to_mavros.launch``，参数已根据您的 T265 朝向配置。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:233
#: 361ee77cffce4688a7e2f4c92f8b2665
msgid "Ground Test"
msgstr "地面测试"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:235
#: 3cbee8c935074392a7ba634c42381181
msgid "After power on, launch all of the ROS nodes."
msgstr "上电后，启动所有 ROS 节点。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:237
#: 8e1b339412c148038b2b0101ae563290
msgid ""
"Generally (but not always), once ``mavros`` is running and the FCU starts "
"receiving ``VISION_POSITION_ESTIMATE`` message, you will see the messages "
"“GPS Glitch” and “GPS Glitch cleared” confirming that the external "
"localization data is being recognized by the system."
msgstr ""
"通常情况下（但并非总是），一旦 ``mavros`` 开始运行且 FCU 开始接收 ``VISION_POSITION_ESTIMATE`` "
"消息，您将看到「GPS Glitch」和「GPS Glitch cleared」消息，确认系统已识别外部定位数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:239
#: c6695c64545a47a0b60cd6d40e36526d
msgid ""
"Now you need to tell the EKF where the vehicle is in the world (i.e. **set "
"EKF home**), otherwise incoming data will not be fused. To do this, you need"
" to send the MAVLink messages `SET_GPS_GLOBAL_ORIGIN "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#SET_GPS_GLOBAL_ORIGIN>`__ and "
"`SET_HOME_POSITION "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#SET_HOME_POSITION>`__. There are"
" a number of options for this to be done:"
msgstr ""
"现在需要告知 EKF 飞行器在世界坐标中的位置（即**设置 EKF 原点**），否则传入数据将不会被融合。为此，需要发送 MAVLink 消息 "
"`SET_GPS_GLOBAL_ORIGIN "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#SET_GPS_GLOBAL_ORIGIN>`__ 和 "
"`SET_HOME_POSITION "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#SET_HOME_POSITION>`__。可通过以下几种方式实现："

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:241
#: 92bda4611ea24805b683331bb4d3c937
msgid ""
"**Use Mission Planner**: Right-click on any point on the map > ``Set Home "
"Here`` > ``Set EKF Origin Here``."
msgstr ""
"**使用 Mission Planner**：在地图上任意点右键单击 > ``Set Home Here`` > ``Set EKF Origin "
"Here``。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:246
#: 460a46398b62491193678e8f53b4d4cc
msgid ""
"**Use code**: to send the required messages to the FCU through MAVLink. In "
"Python, you can use this script `set_origin.py "
"<https://github.com/anbello/aruco_gridboard/blob/master/script/set_origin.py>`__."
msgstr ""
"**使用代码**：通过 MAVLink 向 FCU 发送所需消息。在 Python 中，可使用脚本 `set_origin.py "
"<https://github.com/anbello/aruco_gridboard/blob/master/script/set_origin.py>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:248
#: 6a321fa329e0417791c94bf64231b6de
msgid ""
"Install ``pymavlink``: Follow the instructions `here "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/pymavlink#installation>`__."
msgstr ""
"安装 ``pymavlink``：请按照 `此处 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/pymavlink#installation>`__ 的说明操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:250
#: f8f00cff2c5d404ab82348cf0b8ea22c
msgid "Run the script: ``rosrun vision_to_mavros set_origin.py``."
msgstr "运行脚本：``rosrun vision_to_mavros set_origin.py``。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:252
#: eccc4ded69214d35b54a44a760dc9f9b
msgid "You should see a quadcopter icon appear on the map."
msgstr "地图上应出现四旋翼飞行器图标。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:254
#: 67b700b16cfa437f971a6da5d8348fc1
msgid ""
"Pick-up the vehicle and walk it around, check that the vehicle’s position "
"movements are shown on the map. The trajectory of the vehicle on the map "
"should reflect the real movements without too much distortion or overshoot. "
"Below is an example of walking in a 2m x 2m square."
msgstr ""
"拿起飞行器走动，检查飞行器的位置变化是否显示在地图上。地图上飞行器的轨迹应反映实际运动，不应有过多失真或过冲。以下是在 2m x 2m "
"正方形区域内行走的示例。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:260
#: 73f88e901c384354a900080e4bd5ce3e
msgid "Flight Test"
msgstr "飞行测试"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:262
#: caf7ba04534342c281ecb0ad831097b8
msgid ""
"For your first flight: - Takeoff in Stabilize or Alt-Hold, check that the "
"vehicle is stable."
msgstr "首次飞行：在 Stabilize 或 Alt-Hold 模式下起飞，检查飞行器是否稳定。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:265
#: b01fac07078443c9aa367e68d9769cdb
msgid ""
"Move the vehicle around and observe the position on Mission Planner as well "
"as ``rviz`` to see if tracking is stable."
msgstr "移动飞行器，同时在 Mission Planner 和 ``rviz`` 中观察位置，检查跟踪是否稳定。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:267
#: b78a923db0454e70affcbef34baa61ec
msgid ""
"Switch to Loiter, but always ready to switch back to Stabilize/Alt-Hold if "
"anything goes awry."
msgstr "切换至 Loiter 模式，但始终准备好随时切回 Stabilize/Alt-Hold 模式以防意外。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:269
#: 615bf92f9ff64ea6af3adac96421a50d
msgid ""
"Otherwise, the vehicle should hover stably and able to keep its position. "
"Move the vehicle back and forth 2-3 meters, verify the scale (easier to view"
" on ``rviz``)."
msgstr "飞行器应能稳定悬停并保持位置。将飞行器前后移动 2-3 米，验证比例尺（在 ``rviz`` 中更易于观察）。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:271
#: bd4029a81d5b43899b13955e9d4701f4
msgid ""
"Move the vehicle around (translate, rotate) at varying speed, always ready "
"to switch back to Stabilize/Alt-Hold."
msgstr "以不同速度移动飞行器（平移、旋转），始终准备好切回 Stabilize/Alt-Hold 模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:273
#: 472c9c05c53f42898afb5a142e4f26d8
msgid ""
"If everything works as expected, next time you can arm and take-off in "
"Loiter mode."
msgstr "若一切正常，下次可直接在 Loiter 模式下解锁并起飞。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:277
#: e129382412bf4a20bed8f437bc2f576c
msgid ""
"Always confirm that position feedback is running ok before switching to "
"Loiter mode. Look out for the working boundary in your environment, i.e. "
"where tracking might be lost due to lack of features, fast or rotation "
"movement."
msgstr ""
"切换至 Loiter 模式前，始终确认位置反馈正常运行。注意环境中跟踪可能失效的边界区域，例如特征匮乏、快速运动或旋转运动可能导致跟踪丢失的区域。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:286
#: 96bc92da231c452e94768d45142680f8
msgid "Data Logging"
msgstr "数据日志"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:288
#: 56e1adb47462498ab286c91fecea8503
msgid ""
"Visual odometry information will appear in the ``VISO`` dataflash log "
"messages."
msgstr "视觉里程计信息将出现在 ``VISO`` dataflash 日志消息中。"

